  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-76ec808ec89014325ba72d75",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "若系统增益使得根位于右半平面（RHP），响应会由于不稳定而逐渐增大，直到幅值足够大以使等效增益降低到临界稳定点，从而产生极限环。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "If the system gain is set such that roots are in the RHP, the response builds up due to instability until the magnitude is sufficiently large that the effective gain is lowered to the point of marginal stability, resulting in a limit cycle.",
